<template><div data-hf-id="hf-wvww" data-composition-id="captions-es" data-width="1080" data-height="1920" data-duration="23.366666667" style="position:relative;width:100%;height:100%"><div data-hf-id="hf-dcxc" id="cap-0" class="clip caption" data-start="0.000000000" data-duration="1.100000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-pb8p">Haz una prueba.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-5q2m" id="cap-1" class="clip caption" data-start="1.100000000" data-duration="2.133333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-s630">Pregúntale a alguien qué palabra recuerda</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-z0vl" id="cap-2" class="clip caption" data-start="3.233333333" data-duration="1.533333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-ourh">cuando piensa en tu marca.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-a794" id="cap-3" class="clip caption" data-start="4.766666667" data-duration="1.166666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-23x6">Si te dice cinco cosas</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-ncpp" id="cap-4" class="clip caption" data-start="5.933333333" data-duration="1.833333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-fveg">completamente diferentes,</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-9f2f" id="cap-5" class="clip caption" data-start="7.766666667" data-duration="1.000000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-kjhm">tienes un problema.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-g00w" id="cap-6" class="clip caption" data-start="8.766666667" data-duration="1.466666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-16ud">Porque a veces queremos</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-3e4j" id="cap-7" class="clip caption" data-start="10.233333333" data-duration="1.033333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-t9fg">hablar de todo,</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-4xqn" id="cap-8" class="clip caption" data-start="11.266666667" data-duration="1.500000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-l6d3">cambiar el mensaje todas las semanas</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-nymh" id="cap-9" class="clip caption" data-start="12.766666667" data-duration="0.666666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-xxc3">y terminamos</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-xdi8" id="cap-10" class="clip caption" data-start="13.433333333" data-duration="1.766666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-q815">sin ocupar ningún espacio dentro</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-46ic" id="cap-11" class="clip caption" data-start="15.200000000" data-duration="2.033333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-ekpk">de la cabeza de la gente.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-c5dh" id="cap-12" class="clip caption" data-start="17.233333333" data-duration="2.566666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-8jkq">Posicionamiento también es memoria.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-99r8" id="cap-13" class="clip caption" data-start="19.800000000" data-duration="2.000000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-3dl6">¿Qué palabra quieres que la gente recuerde</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-tj4x" id="cap-14" class="clip caption" data-start="21.800000000" data-duration="1.566666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-yfsg">cuando escuche tu nombre?</p></div></div><script>const root=document.querySelector('[data-composition-id="captions-es"]');const tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});const p0=root.querySelector("#cap-0 p");gsap.set(p0,{opacity:0});tl.set(p0,{opacity:1},0.000000000);tl.set(p0,{opacity:0},1.100000000);const p1=root.querySelector("#cap-1 p");gsap.set(p1,{opacity:0});tl.set(p1,{opacity:1},1.100000000);tl.set(p1,{opacity:0},3.233333333);const p2=root.querySelector("#cap-2 p");gsap.set(p2,{opacity:0});tl.set(p2,{opacity:1},3.233333333);tl.set(p2,{opacity: